contentText:
Justin Bieber is earning the praise of his fellow musicians following his headlining set at Coachella.

Lizzo shared a heartfelt post on Instagram on Sunday (April 12) after watching the Canadian pop star&#8217;s set in person the day prior. Captioning livestream screenshots of Bieber performing on the main stage with an old YouTube video of himself playing on the big screen behind him, she wrote, &#8220;I watched a popstar who grew up in front of the world fully transcend into his artistry last night.&#8221;

